 "note": "S, 14 platforms, mirrored both ways. A wide empty bay splits the map: the only way straight across is a 1-bridge FERRY between the two banks' middle platforms (time it). Each middle platform is a LAUNCHER pad: arm it and its aim sweeps the enemy bank - top, middle, bottom - in turn; a line that walks onto the armed pad is thrown over the bay and lands where the aim stood. The dry ways round are the arcs over the top and under the bottom, each through a crown held by a neutral MACHINEGOON. Each home has three ways out: its front platform (to the pad and the bank corners) and two curved roads to the bank's top and bottom. Finale: the bay ring - both banks and the two crowns - round the empty bay.",
